### ====================================================================
### RepoRadar Server REST API - Test Requests (Module 4: Repositories & Sync)
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension, Postman, or curl
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@projectId = 65d75cf9e1d84f23b890abcd
@repoId = 65d75cf9e1d84f23b890abce

# Set this after calling POST /api/auth/login or POST /api/users/sync-github
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 1. Server Root Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### Authentication & User Sync Endpoints (Module 2 & 3)
### ====================================================================

### 3. Register a New User (Email + Password)
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kunal Saini",
  "email": "kunal@reporadar.io",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### 4. Login User (Obtains JWT Token for NextAuth Credentials & API calls)
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kunal@reporadar.io",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### 5. Synchronize User via GitHub OAuth (Called by NextAuth signIn callback)
# @name syncGithubUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/sync-github
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kunal.github@reporadar.io",
  "name": "Kunal Saini",
  "github_id": 12345678,
  "github_username": "sainikunal5950-sudo",
  "github_access_token": "gho_sampleGithubAccessTokenSecret123456"
}

### 6. Get Current User Profile (Protected with Bearer Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### GitHub Repository Management & Telemetry Endpoints (Module 4 & 5 - Protected)
### ====================================================================

### 7. Sync GitHub Repositories (Calls Octokit with user's encrypted access token)
# @name syncRepositories
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. List All Synced Repositories for Authenticated User (with metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. List Only Selected Repositories for Radar Analysis
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories?selected=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Select Repository for Radar Analysis
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/select
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Deselect Repository from Radar Analysis
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/deselect
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Fetch Detailed Telemetry from GitHub (Metrics, Languages, Commits)
# @name fetchRepositoryDetails
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/fetch-data
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Get Repository Metrics & Language Breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get Paginated Repository Commits
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/commits?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### Source Code Ingestion & File Explorer Endpoints (Module 6 - Protected)
### ====================================================================

### 15. Ingest Source Code & Build Hierarchical File Tree
# @name fetchRepositoryCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/fetch-code
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 16. Get Hierarchical File Tree Structure
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/files/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 17. Get Paginated Repository Files Metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/files?page=1&limit=20&language=typescript
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 18. Get Single File Content by File ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/files/65d75cf9e1d84f23b890abcf
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### Static Rule-Based Code Analysis Endpoints (Module 7 - Protected)
### ====================================================================

### 19. Run Static Code Analysis on Repository
# @name analyzeRepositoryCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analyze-code
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. Get Repository Analysis Summary (Rolled-up Metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analysis-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 21. Get Paginated & Filtered Code Analysis Issues
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analysis-results?severity=critical&issueType=security&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 22. Get Analysis Issues for a Specific File
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analysis-results/65d75cf9e1d84f23b890abcf
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### Repository Health Radar & Visual Analytics Endpoints (Module 8 - Protected)
### ====================================================================

### 23. Calculate Repository Health Scores & Letter Grade
# @name calculateHealthScores
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/calculate-health
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 24. Get Latest Health Scorecard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 25. Get Health Score History Trends
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/health/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 26. Get Health Overview Across All User Repositories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/health-overview
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 27. Get Issue Distribution by Severity (Pie Chart Data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analytics/severity-distribution
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 28. Get Issue Distribution by Category (Bar Chart Data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analytics/type-distribution
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 29. Get Top Problematic Files (Horizontal Bar Chart Data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analytics/top-files?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### Protected Project Resource Endpoints (Requires Authorization Header)
### ====================================================================

### 19. Create Project - Success (Protected)
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RepoRadar Core Engine",
  "description": "AI-powered AST static analysis and vulnerability scanning pipeline"
}

### 13. List All Projects (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get Project By ID (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Update Project (Protected)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RepoRadar Core Engine (Updated v1.4)",
  "description": "Updated description with enhanced multi-language AST support"
}

### 16. Delete Project (Protected)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### Validation & Auth Error Test Cases
### ====================================================================

### 17. Auth Error: Call Protected Endpoint without Token (Expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories
Accept: application/json

### 18. Auth Error: Call Protected Endpoint with Invalid Token (Expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-12345
Accept: application/json

### 19. Sync Error: Sync Repositories without GitHub Linked (Expect 400 GITHUB_NOT_LINKED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. Validation Error: Select Repository with invalid ObjectId (Expect 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/invalid-mongo-id/select
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
